<main class="gg-page">
  <section class="gg-hero gg-hero-new">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Built by three college students</p>
      <h1>Goals that grow with you.</h1>
      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and long-term goals into plants you care for.
        It is a softer way to keep going, built by students who are still growing too.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact#testing" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Join beta testing</a>
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support the build</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-lab">
      <div class="gg-lab-card gg-lab-card-main">
        <span>Today’s Garden</span>
        <div class="gg-plant"></div>
        <h3>Morning Stretch</h3>
        <p>Watered 4 days this week</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-lab-note gg-lab-note-one">missed days are part of the story</div>
      <div class="gg-lab-note gg-lab-note-two">shared gardens are in beta</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="story" class="gg-card-stack-feature">
    <article class="gg-feature-card gg-feature-card-dark">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">Why it exists</p>
        <h2>Goals should feel <span>alive</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-card-bottom">
        <div class="gg-chip-row">
          <span>Habits</span>
          <span>Big goals</span>
          <span>Shared gardens</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Most goal apps feel like a list of things you failed to finish.
          Goal Grower turns progress into something you can see and return to.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-feature-card gg-feature-card-charcoal">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The problem</p>
        <h2>Life gets <span>busy</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-card-bottom">
        <div class="gg-chip-row">
          <span>School</span>
          <span>Work</span>
          <span>Stress</span>
          <span>Missed days</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          We are building this around real life, not perfect streaks.
          The app should make coming back feel possible.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-feature-card gg-feature-card-green">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The loop</p>
        <h2>Plant. Water. <span>Return.</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-card-bottom">
        <div class="gg-chip-row">
          <span>Small actions</span>
          <span>Visual growth</span>
          <span>Gentle reminders</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          One action waters the plant. Progress becomes visible.
          The goal feels less like pressure and more like care.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="gg-feature-card gg-feature-card-paper">
      <div>
        <p class="gg-eyebrow">The mission</p>
        <h2>Grow with <span>people</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-card-bottom">
        <div class="gg-chip-row">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Teams</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Shared gardens help people stay accountable together without making
          growth feel lonely.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-human-section">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">The build</p>
      <h2>Not a giant company. Just three students trying to make something useful.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-human-grid">
      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Built in public</h3>
        <p>We want users to see the project grow while it is still imperfect.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Feedback shaped</h3>
        <p>Beta testers help decide what feels helpful, confusing, or missing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-human-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Made to return to</h3>
        <p>The app is designed around restarting, not shame.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-testing">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Beta testing</p>
      <h2>Help us test Goal Grower before launch.</h2>
      <p>Leave your email to get testing links, early access, and build updates.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-email-card">
      {% form 'customer', class: 'gg-email-form' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="Goal Grower Beta Tester">

        <label for="GoalGrowerEmail">Email for beta testing</label>

        <div class="gg-email-row">
          <input id="GoalGrowerEmail" type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
          <button type="submit">Join list</button>
        </div>

        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          <p class="gg-form-success">Thank you. You are on the testing list.</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if form.errors %}
          <p class="gg-form-error">Please check your email and try again.</p>
        {% endif %}
      {% endform %}

      <p class="gg-email-note">No spam. Just testing and launch updates.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-fund">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Fund the project</p>
      <h2>Support the next version.</h2>
      <p>
        Support helps cover testing, app store costs, design, development,
        and the tools needed to keep Goal Grower moving.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn gg-btn-light">Support development</a>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-fund-card">
      <h3>Support helps with</h3>
      <div><span>01</span><p>Testing and publishing costs</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Shared gardens and reminders</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Better onboarding and tutorials</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Keeping a student-built project alive</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-store">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Store</p>
      <h2>Products that help fund the app.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower merch, journals, desk tools, tech accessories, and small
        products can support development.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/goal-grower" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Merch</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower apparel</h3>
        <p>Simple merch connected to the app.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/stationery" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Desk</span>
        <h3>Journals and planners</h3>
        <p>Offline tools for goals and ideas.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/tech" class="gg-product-card">
        <div class="gg-product-image"></div>
        <span>Tech</span>
        <h3>Focus accessories</h3>
        <p>Small products for calmer routines.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="gg-contact-band">
    <div>
      <p class="gg-eyebrow">Feedback</p>
      <h2>Tell us what would make this better.</h2>
      <p>Send feature ideas, bugs, testing questions, store questions, or general feedback.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn gg-btn-dark">Contact us</a>
  </section>
</main>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Home",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Goal Grower Home"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}